<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT - Aktia cuts UPM to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aktia cuts UPM to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Aktia Bank said on Thursday it had downgraded forestry group UPM-Kymmene Oy to &quot;neutral&quot; from &quot;buy&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The best price development (in the share) is behind us,&quot; Aktia equities analyst Paivi Palomaki told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
